21:30.037 --> 21:36.701
I will now free myself, however I can, from the mire of these difficult, conflicting thoughts.

21:37.621 --> 21:45.445
And even if, just for a single instant, focus on the Tathagata's body, which is of such great merit and significance.

21:46.146 --> 21:52.809
In doing so, I shall achieve the yogas of calm abiding and insight in their proper way.

21:53.830 --> 21:57.512
