22:10.924 --> 22:12.726
What good have they brought us?

22:14.006 --> 22:26.975
If we were to consider ourselves, if we were to consider our mind and the discursive thoughts running therein, let's say we were to give them form, they probably wouldn't fit in this temple, would they?

22:29.008 --> 22:38.770
And so when we think about it, the sheer volume of discursive thought that we give to every day, okay, there's a lot of them.

22:39.010 --> 22:40.510
But what benefit have they brought us?

22:40.950 --> 22:42.130
There's great benefit to them.

22:42.650 --> 22:42.931
Great.

22:43.931 --> 22:45.531
But it's the opposite, isn't it?

22:46.271 --> 22:53.232
All of these disturbing thoughts have only brought us dissatisfaction and further dissatisfaction.

22:53.312 --> 22:55.993
Accordingly, we've been brought low as we read.

22:56.633 --> 23:00.497
