54:20.567 --> 54:31.434
And, by persevering in this way, discursive thoughts, which were so apparent and rough, wild and turbulent, will settle down slightly after a while.

54:33.163 --> 54:41.588
But there will still be the busyness of the many different thoughts, a bubbling stream of restless mental activity.

54:42.408 --> 54:53.455
