57:06.121 --> 57:10.767
But when you get up close, you'll see that it is moving, alight and rippling.

57:13.583 --> 57:26.117
Accordingly then, from this point on, if you don't stop persevering, but keep on striving, you will have less hardship and suffering than before.

57:27.218 --> 57:29.621
So exert yourself continuously, we are told.

57:30.802 --> 57:37.846
By practicing like this, even the movement of subtle conceptual thoughts will be pacified.

57:38.647 --> 57:43.709
