58:54.461 --> 58:57.782
And this then is synonymous with effortless engagement.

58:59.433 --> 59:07.675
The mind naturally mixes with whatever you focus on, and without the need for any effort, remains steadily wherever you want it to.

59:08.776 --> 59:13.877
Conceptual or discursive thoughts no longer have the power to shake your mind.

59:14.157 --> 59:20.459
And this is the accomplishment, is what is called the one-pointedness of a mind of the desire realm.

